+// v126: mirror the gate that hardware/broadcom/wlan/bcmdhd/config/Android.bp
+// already has. Both trees declare a prebuilt_etc named "wpa_supplicant.conf"
+// installing to $(TARGET_COPY_OUT_VENDOR)/etc/wifi, and this one used to be
